    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### **1. Schedule Trigger**\nThis is the alarm clock of your automation. It decides **when** everything runs.\n\n#### Configuration\n* **Trigger type:** Cron\n* **Mode:** Every day\n* **Time:** `07:00 AM`\n* **Timezone:** Asia/Manila",
        "height": 272,
        "width": 432
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "39ac310e-96e2-4a56-8f5b-7ac2ef39ab2a",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "\n### **2. Openweather API Node (HTTP Request)**\nCalls OpenWeather and retrieves:\n* City\n* Date\n* Temperature\n* Weather condition\n* Others\n\n#### Configuration\n* **Method:** `GET`\n* **URL:**  `https://api.openweathermap.org/data/2.5/weather`\n \n* **Query Parameters:**\n  * `q` → `\"Manila\"`\n  * `units` → `metric`\n  * `appid` → `YOUR_API_KEY`\n  * `lang`  → `en`",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 400
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        448,
        0
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "3f3a4c47-ee43-4a04-9ff7-d05df40275e7",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### **3. Data Transmission Node**\nNormalizes weather data so downstream nodes.\n#### Typical output structure\n```json\n{\n  \"city\": \"Manila\",\n  \"temp\": 31,\n  \"condition\": \"Cloudy\",\n  \"description\": \"broken clouds\"\n}\n```",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 384
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        864,
        0
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "87daae85-9b8a-429c-9637-0e7bf8138d11",
      "name": "Sticky Note4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "\n### **4. Placid – Image Generation Node (HTTP Request)**\n\nSends data to Placid to generate an image using a **template**.\n\n### Configuration\n* **Method:** `POST`\n* **URL:** `https://api.placid.app/api/rest/images`\n* **Headers:**\n  * `Generic Credential Type`\n  * `Header Auth`\n  * `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_PLACID_API_KEY`\n  * `Content-Type: application/json`\n### Body (important)\n```json\n{\n  \"template_uuid\": \"08ueahvvqu309\",\n  \"layers\": {\n    \"city\": { \"text\": \"{{ $json.city }}\" },\n    \"emoji\": { \"text\": \"{{ $json.emoji }}\" },\n    \"date\": { \"text\": \"{{ $json.date }}\" },\n    \"temp\": { \"text\": \"{{ $json.temp }}°C\" },\n    \"condition\": { \"text\": \"{{ $json.condition }}\" }\n  }\n}\n```\n**Note: Layer names must EXACTLY match** Placid template layer IDs\n(Placid is case-sensitive and unforgiving)\n\n",
        "height": 864,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1264,
        0
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "96b30342-5a9d-43dc-8e53-c33207e89acf",
      "name": "Sticky Note5"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### **5. Wait Node**\n\n#### Configuration\n* **Wait mode:** Time interval\n* **Duration:** 30 seconds (Placid Image generation takes atleast 30 seconds before completely generated)\n",
        "height": 864,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1696,
        0
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "9ace23f5-24bc-45af-bec2-5c9d8fa4bf71",
      "name": "Sticky Note6"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### ** 6. HTTP Request (Image Status Check)**\nPolls Placid using the image ID returned earlier.\n#### Configuration\n* **Method:** `GET`\n* **URL:** `https://api.placid.app/api/rest/images/{{ $json.id }}`\n* **Auth:** `Same Placid API key`\n\n#### Expected response\n```json\n{\n\"id\": {{ $json.id }},\n\"type\": \"image\",\n\"status\": \"queued\", \n\"image_url\": null,\n\"transfer_url\": null,\n\"polling_url\": \"https://api.placid.app/api/rest/images/{{ $json.id }}\",\n\"passthrough\": null,\n\"errors\": \n}\n```",
        "height": 864,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2128,
        0
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "966615bf-dcef-4a99-8367-f33aa2330d7a",
      "name": "Sticky Note7"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "\n### **7. Image Status Checker (IF Node)**\n**Proceed only if `status = finished`**\n#### Condition\n* value1: `{{ $json.status }}`\n* Operation: `is not equals to`\n* value2: `finished`\n\n#### Logic\n* **False** → Continue to posting\n* **True** → Loop back → Wait → Check again\n",
        "height": 864,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2560,
        0
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "6cd03234-6b43-40c3-aee9-3b8d9d98880f",
      "name": "Sticky Note8"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### **9.Facebook Posting (HTTP Request)**\nUploads image + caption to Facebook Page.\n\n### Configuration\n* **Method:** `POST`\n* **URL:**`https://graph.facebook.com/v24.0/PAGE_ID/photos`\n* `Generic Credential Type`\n  * `Header Auth`\n  * `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_PAGE_API_TOKEN`\n  * `Content-Type: application/json`\n```json\n{\n  \"url\": \"{{$json[\"image_url\"]}}\",\n  \"caption\": \"{{$json[\"caption\"]}}\"\n}\n ```\n### Credentials setup\n* Use **Facebook Graph API**\n* Token MUST have:\n  * `pages_manage_posts`\n  * `pages_read_engagement`\n  * Page access token (not user token)\n\n",
        "height": 864,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3424,
        0
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "dc8213b8-cccb-47da-bad6-ed18085dab9a",
      "name": "Sticky Note9"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "\n### **8. Merge (Combine)**\n**“Reunite Data Transmission Data + Placid Image Generation.”**\n* **Combine**\n* Input 1 → Data Transmission Data\n* Input 2 → Placid Image Generation",
        "height": 864,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2992,
        0
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "f2a9587c-52b7-4ea5-8fb6-b6edaa1eae75",
      "name": "Sticky Note10"
    },
